>by</span><span begin="00:30.013" end="00:33.014">：</span><span begin="00:33.014" end="00:36.015">Christian</span><span begin="00:36.015" end="00:39.016"> </span><span begin="00:39.016" end="00:42.017">Baello</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.029" end="00:43.253"><span begin="00:42.029" end="00:42.445">Through </span><span begin="00:42.445" end="00:42.709">it </span><span begin="00:42.709" end="00:43.253">all</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.725" end="00:45.117"><span begin="00:43.725" end="00:44.189">Once </span><span begin="00:44.189" end="00:45.117">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.595" end="00:48.387"><span begin="00:45.595" end="00:45.923">Came </span><span begin="00:45.923" end="00:46.171">to </span><span begin="00:46.171" end="00:46.875">know </span><span begin="00:46.875" end="00:47.211">my </span><span begin="00:47.211" end="00:47.771">only </span><span begin="00:47.771" end="00:48.387">friend</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.891" end="00:50.171"><span begin="00:48.891" end="00:49.347">Lost </span><span begin="00:49.347" end="00:50.171">control</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.946" end="00:56.953"><span begin="00:55.946" end="00:56.281">Can't </span><span begin="00:56.281" end="00:56.953">begin</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.401" end="00:58.762"><span begin="00:57.401" end="00:57.609">I </span><span begin="00:57.609" end="00:57.898">seek </span><span begin="00:57.898" end="00:58.762">within</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.932" end="01:02.100"><span begin="00:58.932" end="00:59.172">To </span><span begin="00:59.172" end="00:59.524">feel </span><span begin="00:59.524" end="00:59.804">the </span><span begin="00:59.804" end="01:00.308">warmth </span><span begin="01:00.596" end="01:00.860">brought </span><span begin="01:00.860" end="01:01.236">within </span><span begin="01:01.236" end="01:01.564">your </span><span begin="01:01.564" end="01:02.100">skin</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.726" end="01:04.158"><span begin="01:02.726" end="01:02.990">Did </span><span begin="01:02.990" end="01:03.278">you </span><span begin="01:03.278" end="01:04.158">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.418" end="01:13.027"><span begin="01:08.418" end="01:08.682">For </span><span begin="01:08.682" end="01:10.394">how </span><span begin="01:10.394" end="01:11.594">it </span><span begin="01:11.594" end="01:13.027">seemed</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.466" end="01:19.882"><span begin="01:13.466" end="01:13.754">I </span><span begin="01:13.754" end="01:14.242">should've </span><span begin="01:14.242" end="01:14.874">stayed </span><span begin="01:14.874" end="01:15.402">and </span><span begin="01:15.402" end="01:17.242">let </span><span begin="01:17.242" end="01:18.578">you </span><span begin="01:18.578" end="01:19.882">be</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.464" end="01:26.592"><span begin="01:20.464" end="01:20.688">Run </span><span begin="01:20.688" end="01:21.040">into </span><span begin="01:21.040" end="01:21.320">my </span><span begin="01:21.320" end="01:21.696">heart </span><span begin="01:21.696" end="01:22.280">so </span><span begin="01:22.280" end="01:26.592">carelessly</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.192" end="01:30.200"><span begin="01:27.192" end="01:27.408">That's </span><span begin="01:27.408" end="01:27.616">the </span><span begin="01:27.616" end="01:28.168">reason </span><span begin="01:28.168" end="01:28.664">I'm </span><span begin="01:28.664" end="01:30.200">afraid</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.479" end="01:33.479"><span begin="01:30.479" end="01:30.799">You're </span><span begin="01:30.799" end="01:31.191">thoughts </span><span begin="01:31.191" end="01:31.479">that </span><span begin="01:31.479" end="01:31.959">can't </span><span begin="01:31.959" end="01:32.431">be </span><span begin="01:32.431" end="01:33.479">tamed</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.018" end="01:36.450"><span begin="01:34.018" end="01:34.226">And </span><span begin="01:34.226" end="01:34.434">I'm </span><span begin="01:34.434" end="01:34.930">trying </span><span begin="01:34.930" end="01:35.322">to </span><span begin="01:35.322" end="01:35.914">be </span><span begin="01:35.914" end="01:36.450">sane</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.450" end="01:40.926"><span begin="01:36.450" end="01:40.926">Ah</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.926" end="01:43.758"><span begin="01:40.926" end="01:41.126">And </span><span begin="01:41.126" end="01:41.318">I'm </span><span begin="01:41.318" end="01:41.806">trying </span><span begin="01:41.806" end="01:42.206">to </span><span begin="01:42.206" end="01:42.718">be </span><span begin="01:42.718" end="01:43.758">sane</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.758" end="01:46.462"><span begin="01:43.758" end="01:46.462">Ah</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.654" end="01:50.264"><span begin="01:47.654" end="01:47.870">And </span><span begin="01:47.870" end="01:48.086">I'm </span><span begin="01:48.086" end="01:48.685">trying </span><span begin="01:48.685" end="01:49.101">to </span><span begin="01:49.101" end="01:49.646">be </span><span begin="01:49.646" end="01:50.264">sane</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.264" end="02:03.064"><span begin="01:50.264" end="01:56.544">Ah </span><span begin="01:56.544" end="02:03.064">ah</span></p></div></body></tt>